{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","section":{"9":"The Chapters on Marriage"},"section_detail":{"9":{"hadithnumber_first":1845,"hadithnumber_last":2015,"arabicnumber_first":1845,"arabicnumber_last":2015,"name_native":"নিকাহ (বিয়ে) অধ্যায়"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1965,"arabicnumber":1965,"text":"। ইবনু ‘আব্বাস (রাঃ) থেকে বর্ণিত। নবী সাল্লাল্লাহু আলাইহি ওয়াসাল্লাম ইহরাম অবস্থায় বিবাহ করেন।","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Shadh"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Shadh"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Muslim"}],"reference":{"book":9,"hadith":121}}]}